# framewright drives the `claude` CLI (Claude Code), which auto-loads any
# installed skills (hyperframes, website-to-hyperframes, hyperframes-media,
# lottie, etc.) when their trigger phrases match the prompt.
#
# No ANTHROPIC_API_KEY needed here — Claude Code handles auth on your machine.

# Optional: pin which Claude Code binary to use (e.g. an absolute path)
# FRAMEWRIGHT_CLAUDE_BIN=/opt/homebrew/bin/claude

# Optional: pin which `hyperframes` invocation to use
# HYPERFRAMES_BIN=npx --yes hyperframes
